<title>USA: Lubrizol names Cleveland-Cliffs CEO to board.</title>
<headline>Lubrizol names Cleveland-Cliffs CEO to board.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lubrizol Corp said Monday it appointed M. Thomas Moore to fill a vacancy on its board.</p>
<p>The company said Moore is chairman and chief executive of Cleveland-Cliffs Inc.</p>
<p>Lubrizol is a supplier of performance chemicals for lubricants, fuels and other specialty markets.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
